b for months  the talk is about really daring  motorcycle stunt that took place during  the movie shooting in norway  tom cruise himself is seen riding off a  long ramp into the abyss  opening his parachute at the last moment  after  many extraordinary stunts by the 50 year  old and new climax seems to have been  reached in the most  literal sense of the word speaking in an  interview with empire he himself sees it  the same way and sums up that a single  puff of wind would have been enough to  knock him  off balance in addition he had to be  careful not to get entangled on the  motorcycle as  otherwise he would have fallen with a  motorcycle into the depth  considering that the actor is already  celebrating his 60th birthday next year  the performance is  all the more amazing another sneak peek  is provided by a picture that shows the  actor standing nonchalantly on a moving  train  you can find out what the whole film  will look like when it's released on may  27  2022 no one was expecting this  dave bautista will move on from his  popular role as drax after the upcoming  guardians of the galaxy vol 3. the u.s  actor announced this in the course of a  promotional interview for his upcoming  movie  army of the dead and has a very  reasonable explanation for his decision  on the one hand his contract with marvel  ants after guardians of the galaxy iii  on the other hand he wished that more  would have been made of his character he  does have a point after all rex brings  an interesting character and background  story that marvel  in his opinion had completely forgotten  about however he himself expressly  emphasized that this is not an attack on  marvel given that marvel has its own  plans for the mcu director james gunn  was the first to express his regret  making it clear that there could be no  other drax than bodista even though he  accepted the actor's decision  in order to prevent misunderstandings  bautista also let the fans know that the  character  drax will of course live on in the mcu  but merely without him as a cast member  especially interesting in this regard is  a statement by james gunn regarding a  fourth part in fact it is supposed to  end after part three  though on twitter gun didn't really give  a clear no  and asked whether he would direct part  4. thus part 4 shouldn't be completely  ruled out although the signs are more in  favor of an end after part 3.  guardians of the galaxy vol 3 is  expected to be released at the beginning  of may 2023  in 2014 the popular u.s blockbuster edge  of tomorrow starring tom cruise and  emily blunt hit theaters  in an interview with howard stern blonde  spoke out about a potential follow-up  unfortunately blonde doesn't seem to be  too upbeat she personally thinks that  edge of tomorrow 2 will be far too  expensive after the first part cost  almost 200 million us dollars to produce  this is not an unjustified objection  despite the fact that tom cruise emily  blunt and director doug lyman have  frequently expressed their interest in  the sequel  i'm going to talk earlier this year  about wanting to make a sequel  substantially smaller than the original  and now we know why so it remains  unclear whether a cut down sequel with a  focus on the characters  will actually be realized paramount has  published  seven images from its plant series  adaption paw patrol  the popular franchise has been a  nickelodeon since 2013 and deals with  the live of young writer and his six  differently gifted four-legged  companions each of the ducks has a  specific position for example  one's a policeman the other firefighter  the paramount project has done a great  job with its voice actors including  jimmy kimmel tyler perry  reynold park and kim kardashian as part  of its cast apart from the dock chase  all the main actors from the series will  also be featured in terms of content the  well coordinated team faces the rival  mayor of adventure city and as he starts  to wreak havoc  ryder 